1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,250
If you jumped into a hole

2
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:02,500
through the middle of the Earth,

3
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:04,060
you would never hit the bottom.

4
00:00:04,114 --> 00:00:05,844
It's Sunday morning, and Gus has

5
00:00:05,854 --> 00:00:06,874
just dug a hole in his

6
00:00:06,884 --> 00:00:08,294
garden, straight through the

7
00:00:08,304 --> 00:00:08,744
planet.

8
00:00:08,798 --> 00:00:10,118
His neighbor says he'll burn to

9
00:00:10,128 --> 00:00:10,588
a crisp.

10
00:00:10,642 --> 00:00:12,172
His wife says he'll go splat

11
00:00:12,182 --> 00:00:13,042
on the other side.

12
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,186
Gus says he did the math,

13
00:00:14,196 --> 00:00:14,876
and jumps.

14
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:16,270
He's pumped out all the air,

15
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,840
so nothing slows him down.

16
00:00:17,894 --> 00:00:19,424
Two minutes in, he's outrunning a

17
00:00:19,434 --> 00:00:19,874
bullet.

18
00:00:19,928 --> 00:00:21,548
Nineteen minutes in, he shoots

19
00:00:21,558 --> 00:00:22,728
through the center of the Earth

20
00:00:22,738 --> 00:00:24,298
at twenty two thousand miles an

21
00:00:24,308 --> 00:00:24,738
hour.

22
00:00:24,782 --> 00:00:26,042
The walls are as hot as

23
00:00:26,052 --> 00:00:27,262
the surface of the Sun.

24
00:00:27,492 --> 00:00:28,652
It's a very good tunnel.

25
00:00:28,696 --> 00:00:29,146
But wait.

26
00:00:29,156 --> 00:00:30,446
Why doesn't he go splat?

27
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:32,370
You see, gravity only pulls Gus

28
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:33,180
toward the middle.

29
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,980
So the moment he passes it,

30
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:36,040
the pull that sped him up

31
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:37,390
starts slowing him down.

32
00:00:37,434 --> 00:00:38,354
Ever pushed a kid on a

33
00:00:38,364 --> 00:00:38,974
swing?

34
00:00:39,144 --> 00:00:40,564
All the speed it gains going

35
00:00:40,574 --> 00:00:42,214
down, it spends going back up.

36
00:00:42,268 --> 00:00:43,778
So thirty eight minutes after he

37
00:00:43,788 --> 00:00:45,488
jumped, Gus pops up in the

38
00:00:45,498 --> 00:00:46,818
middle of the ocean, on the

39
00:00:46,828 --> 00:00:48,108
far side of the world, and

40
00:00:48,118 --> 00:00:48,778
stops.

41
00:00:48,832 --> 00:00:50,742
Luckily, he stops for exactly one

42
00:00:50,752 --> 00:00:51,182
moment.

43
00:00:51,226 --> 00:00:53,086
Unluckily, he stops for exactly

44
00:00:53,096 --> 00:00:53,766
one moment.

45
00:00:53,810 --> 00:00:55,490
Then down he goes again, and

46
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,090
thirty eight minutes later, he's

47
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,380
back in his own garden.

48
00:00:58,434 --> 00:00:59,744
So Gus never did hit the

49
00:00:59,754 --> 00:01:00,364
bottom.

50
00:01:00,664 --> 00:01:01,894
He just comes home for one

51
00:01:01,904 --> 00:01:04,294
second, every seventy six minutes.
